171
00:13:52,525 --> 00:13:54,145
Look for him again, you simpleton!

172
00:13:54,145 --> 00:13:56,705
No way.

173
00:13:56,845 --> 00:13:57,945
I think he's still back there.

174
00:13:57,985 --> 00:14:00,505
He probably fell asleep right on the ground.

175
00:14:00,745 --> 00:14:03,545
Either that or the moron yelled himself straight into a coma.

176
00:14:05,445 --> 00:14:06,505
I'll go in check!

177
00:14:06,925 --> 00:14:08,145
Yeah, me too.

178
00:14:08,565 --> 00:14:09,625
Just to be sure.

179
00:14:13,925 --> 00:14:16,105
Sounds like Straw Boy's the one doing the yelling.

180
00:14:16,725 --> 00:14:18,745
You know, I bet he went to bed already.

181
00:14:19,245 --> 00:14:20,805
We just didn't notice when he left.

182
00:14:21,585 --> 00:14:22,065
Hang!

183
00:14:22,485 --> 00:14:23,625
Hang in there!

184
00:14:24,145 --> 00:14:39,145
What do you think he's going to accomplish with this madness?

185
00:14:42,645 --> 00:14:43,145
You...

186
00:14:43,145 --> 00:14:52,645
Straw Boy!

187
00:14:52,645 --> 00:14:53,145
Straw Boy!

188
