Let that man do as he wishes.

195
00:15:23,005 --> 00:15:24,625
But he...

196
00:15:24,625 --> 00:15:29,565
The only way that Bon Boy could show his support is to struggle alongside his friend.

197
00:15:30,105 --> 00:15:31,945
Straw Hat Boy's odds aren't great.

198
00:15:32,065 --> 00:15:34,765
If a cheer can help even the slightest, then he has to try.

199
00:15:34,765 --> 00:15:38,345
And if it can't, at least he won't be alone in his final moments.

200
00:15:38,345 --> 00:15:40,405
Straw Hat Boy!

201
00:15:40,405 --> 00:15:42,185
Straw Hat Boy!

202
00:15:45,265 --> 00:15:48,405
They've long since passed the limit of human endurance.

203
00:15:48,625 --> 00:15:49,365
Of pain.

204
00:15:52,865 --> 00:15:55,445
But that's what it takes to create a miracle!

205
00:15:55,445 --> 00:16:18,405
For more than 10 hours now, Straw Boy has been suffering, fighting against destiny itself to reclaim his life.

206
00:16:18,405 --> 00:16:33,405
And if he isn't giving up, I won't give up either.

207
00:16:34,905 --> 00:16:38,125
I'll keep cheering to the bitter end!

208
00:16:38,125 --> 00:16:48,225
So, please, hang in there!

209
00:16:49,665 --> 00:16:51,885
Hang in there!

210
00:16:52,765 --> 00:16:56,125
You have to live, Straw Boy!

211
00:16:58,125 --> 00:16:59,765
Hang in there!

