00:17:06,185 --> 00:17:07,645
Hang in there!

216
00:17:08,125 --> 00:17:09,505
Hang in there!

217
00:17:09,505 --> 00:17:11,965
We believe in you!

218
00:17:13,465 --> 00:17:14,585
Straw Boy!

219
00:17:15,845 --> 00:17:17,545
Hang in there!

220
00:17:18,625 --> 00:17:20,545
Hang in there!

221
00:17:20,545 --> 00:17:21,265
We're all over!

222
00:17:21,265 --> 00:17:22,925
Straw Boy!

223
00:17:23,925 --> 00:17:25,545
Hang in there!

224
00:17:26,625 --> 00:17:27,545
Straw Boy!

225
00:17:29,545 --> 00:17:30,545
Straw Boy!

226
00:17:30,545 --> 00:17:31,545
Straw Boy!

